ok><name>YU, DAXI</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YU DABANG</name><address><country>CN</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YU DAXI</name><address><country>CN</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YU, DABANG</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YU, DAXI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>The present invention relates to a pure rolling bearing without cage members and sliding friction, comprising an inner ring, an outer ring, rolling members provided between the inner and outer rings, positioning rolling members and positioning rings. Every positioning rolling member is provided between two adjacent rolling members and contacts therewith. The positioning rings are positined on the slideway at the two ends of the said positioning rolling members and keep rolling contact therewith.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un palier à roulement simple ne présentant ni cage de retenue ni frottement par glissement et comprenant une bague interne, une bague externe, des galets placés entre les bagues interne et externe, des galets de positionnement et des bagues de positionnement. Chaque galet de positionnement placé entre deux galets adjacents est en contact avec ceux-ci. Les bagues de positionnement se trouvent sur le parcours de glissement des deux extrémités des galets de positionnement et sont en contact de glissement avec celles-ci.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under a